%% Code blocks: syntax highlighting and per-step line highlighting.
%%   lmr2svg examples/code/deck.lmr -o code.html
!title Code
!madewith

!slide A highlighted block

Code is syntax-highlighted at build time (pygments -> theme palette):

:: python
	def sum_product(node, incoming):
	    msg = node.factor
	    for m in incoming:
	        msg = msg * m
	    return normalize(msg)

!slide Highlighting by step

The bracket after the language highlights lines on the given steps — group 1 on
step 1, lines 4--5 on step 2 (non-active lines dim):

:: python[1|4-5]
	def sum_product(node, incoming):
	    msg = node.factor
	    for m in incoming:
	        msg = msg * m
	    return normalize(msg)
